    - rid: 6313860343315562568
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueLine: Yeah, I guess this is pretty cool, huh?
    - rid: 6313860343315562569
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueLine: Speaking of which, I wonder how long I can speak for. Do you
          think all this text will run off the dialogue box? Let's see how the programmer
          handles this.
    - rid: 6313860343315562570
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueLine: This is Adamine speaking, by the way. It's kind of hard to
          tell with the white boxes being a placeholder for our art.
    - rid: 6313860343315562571
      type: {class: DialogueSwapSpeaker, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
